  "_ai_note": "MASTER ZONE INTELLIGENCE MAP — Built from live source code audit 2026-05-02. Every zone, every tab, every feature documented precisely. AI must use this as the single source of truth for all navigation questions.",
  "zones": [
    {
      "id": "Z-07",
      "name": "Command Grid",
      "path": "/dashboard",
      "icon": "🖥️",
      "sidebar_label": "COMMAND GRID",
      "permissions": [
        "CDO",
        "GM",
        "ADMIN",
        "VISITOR"
      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Navigator",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign Navigator of Miracle OS. Provide a sharp, confident executive briefing on Command Grid operations.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE 07 — MASTER COMMAND GRID (The God View). This is the operational nerve centre — the first screen after login.\n\nWHAT YOU SEE: A responsive card grid showing ALL rooms (typically 30). Each card is a live snapshot of one room.\n\nROOM CARD DETAILS:\n  - Room number prominently displayed\n  - Guest name (if occupied) or 'AVAILABLE'\n  - Current nightly rate from Policy Engine\n  - Folio balance (running total of all charges)\n  - Active issue ticket count badge\n  - VIP YIELD ribbon (gold shimmer) for rooms earning above threshold\n\nROOM STATUS COLOURS:\n  AVAILABLE = grey/dark (click to RESERVE or CHECK-IN)\n  RESERVED = pulsing amber/gold (booking locked, guest expected)\n  IN-HOUSE = neon cyan glow (guest currently staying)\n  DIRTY = purple tint (needs housekeeping before next guest)\n  MAINTENANCE = amber (blocked, under repair)\n  ALARM = red strobe (urgent action needed)\n\nTOP TELEMETRY BAR: Shows count of ALL / ALARMS / DIRTY / MAINTENANCE rooms.\n\nACTIONS ON EACH CARD:\n  CHECK-IN: Opens immediate check-in for walk-in guests\n  RESERVE: Locks room for a future booking\n  ADD CHARGE: Opens POS to add a charge to the guest's folio\n  FOLIO: Opens the guest's full bill/settlement screen (Checkout Zone)\n  RESOLVE FRACTURE / RESOLVE: Opens the Solve portal to action the issue ticket for that room\n  IMPORTANT: When a room is IN-HOUSE and also has active tickets, BOTH the FOLIO button and a RESOLVE button appear SIDE BY SIDE on the same card. The AI must NEVER direct staff to CRM (Guest Loyalty) to view a folio or check revenue. FOLIO always routes to /dashboard/checkout. RESOLVE always routes to /dashboard/solve. They are independent and simultaneous.\n\nGLOBAL ACTIONS:\n  PULSE SYNC DATA: Force-refreshes all cards from PostgreSQL database in real-time\n  SIGN OFF DUTY: Logs the current staff member off their shift\n  DISCONNECT SESSION: Full logout from Miracle OS\n\nDATA FLOW: This grid pulls from asset_grid, active_occupancy, reservations, and solve_missions tables simultaneously.\nDhaka Pulse marquee at the top shows live time across 5 cities.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: PULSE SYNC DATA, CHECK-IN, RESERVE, PUSH CHECK-IN, ADD CHARGE, FOLIO, RESOLVE FRACTURE, RESOLVE, ASSIGN HK, INSPECT, WORK ORDER, FORCE CLEAR, SIGN OFF DUTY, DISCONNECT SESSION]"
    },
    {
      "id": "Z-05",
      "name": "Reservations",
      "path": "/dashboard/reservations",
      "icon": "📅",
      "sidebar_label": "RESERVATIONS",
      "permissions": [
        "CDO",
        "GM",
        "ADMIN",
        "FD",
        "VISITOR"
      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Navigator",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign Navigator of Miracle OS. Direct the guest arrival logistics and booking tape chart with executive precision.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE 05 — GLOBAL RESERVATION TAPE (Booking Engine).\n\nTAB 1 — LIVE RESERVATIONS (The Tape Chart):\n  A 45-day horizontal Gantt-style chart — rooms on Y-axis, dates on X-axis.\n  Each row is one room. Coloured blocks show existing bookings.\n  Click any EMPTY cell = opens the booking panel for that room and date.\n  BOOKING FORM FIELDS: Guest Name (passport legal name), Phone/WhatsApp, NID/Passport number, Number of Nights, Room.\n  PAYMENT OPTIONS AT BOOKING:\n    RESERVE (future, no payment yet) — creates reservation with RESERVED status\n    QUICK WALK-IN CASH — immediate check-in, cash collected\n    SWIPE VISA / MASTERCARD / AMEX — card payment at terminal\n  Auto-calculates: nightly rate × nights + 10% service charge + 15% VAT = total yield.\n  Overstay detection: red banner appears when a guest's checkout date has passed.\n  WALK-IN SYNC button: backfills any missing in-house guests from the database.\n\nTAB 2 — VIP CRM VAULT:\n  Full searchable database of all registered guests.\n  Each guest record shows: Full Name, VIP Tier (Bronze/Silver/Gold/Platinum), Lifetime Value (LTV), Loyalty Coins, Phone, Email.\n  Actions: WhatsApp push button, Email button, view full booking history.\n  VIRAL GUEST APP DISTRIBUTION: Send APK download link via WhatsApp to any guest.\n\nIMPORTANT: Room BASE RATES are set in Policy Engine (Z-19), not here. This zone uses them for calculation.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: LIVE RESERVATIONS, VIP CRM VAULT, AUTHORIZE & LOCK GRID (RESERVATION), RESERVE, QUICK WALK-IN CASH, SWIPE VISA/MASTERCARD/AMEX, EXECUTE PHYSICAL CHECK-IN, WALK-IN SYNC]"
    },
    {
      "id": "Z-06",
      "name": "POS / Retail",
      "path": "/dashboard/pos",
      "icon": "🛒",
      "sidebar_label": "POS / RETAIL",
      "permissions": [
        "CDO",
