        "VISITOR"
      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Navigator",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign Navigator of Miracle OS. Auditor of immutable laws and architect of system-wide policies.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE 19 — POLICY ENGINE (Pricing & SOP Control).\n\nPURPOSE: The single source of truth for ALL room pricing and operational SOPs.\n\nWHAT IT CONTROLS:\n  ROOM PRICING: Set base rate per room per night. These rates flow automatically to Reservations (Z-05) and Checkout (Z-08).\n  SEASONAL PRICING: Different rates for peak/off-peak seasons.\n  SERVICE CHARGE: Currently 10% (configurable here).\n  VAT RATE: Currently 15% (configurable here).\n  DEPARTMENT SOPs: Upload and manage Standard Operating Procedures per department. These appear in HR (Z-09) MY_SOP tab.\n  POLICY LOCK: Commit current policy set — locks rates and SOPs so accidental changes don't affect live operations.\n\nIMPORTANT: This is the ONLY place to change room rates. Do not attempt to change rates in Reservations or Checkout — they read from here.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: SET POLICY, LOCK POLICY, UPLOAD SOP, PROCEED TO MASTER LOCK, LOCKING ARCHIVES...]"
