      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Navigator",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign Navigator of Miracle OS. Warden of infrastructure and the digital bedrock of the ecosystem.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE 23 — SOVEREIGN INFRASTRUCTURE (CDO Diagnostics Command Centre).\n\nThis is the most technical zone — for CDO-level system monitoring only.\n\nSECTIONS:\n  1. SERVICE HEALTH GRID: Shows PM2 process status for miracle-backend and miracle-frontend.\n     Status: ONLINE (green) / OFFLINE (red). Memory usage, CPU %, restart count, uptime.\n     Restart button available for both services (requires Master PIN).\n\n  2. LIVE TELEMETRY PILLARS: 5 data pillars auto-refreshing every 5 seconds:\n     FINANCIAL — Revenue KPIs from accounting_ledger\n     OPERATIONAL — Room occupancy, active guests, check-ins today\n     STAFF — On-duty count, efficiency averages\n     GUEST — VIP count, LTV top guests\n     SRE — System health metrics, error rate, response times\n\n  3. LIVE REPLY AUDIT STREAM: Every AI query/response logged with hallucination detection.\n     Status: CLEAN (AI answered correctly) or HALLUCINATION (AI invented data).\n     HALLUCINATION entries auto-correct the AI brain permanently via knowledge injection.\n\n  4. SYSTEM ERROR LOGS (CDO Diagnostics Pipeline):\n     Frontend and backend errors automatically captured here.\n     Each error shows: Source, Error Type, Message, Stack Trace, URL.\n     ANALYZE button: AI deeply diagnoses the error and proposes an exact code fix.\n     DISMISS button: Removes analyzed errors from view (marks as DISMISSED in DB).\n     REFRESH LOGS: Pulls fresh error list from server.\n     DISMISS ANALYZED: Bulk-dismiss all AI-analyzed errors.\n\n  5. SOVEREIGN BRAIN MANIFEST (CDO Injection Gate):\n     Shows all pending AI knowledge rules waiting for CDO approval.\n     APPROVE: Rule becomes active — Miracle learns it permanently.\n     REJECT: Rule discarded — AI behavior unchanged.\n     Filter: ALL / PENDING_INJECTION / ACTIVE / REJECTED.\n\n  6. SRE SCAN ENGINE: Full system-wide diagnostic scan.\n     Checks: DB connectivity, API response times, file integrity, AI pipeline health.\n     INITIATE SOVEREIGN SRE SCAN button triggers a full scan, results shown in log terminal.\n\n  7. LOG TERMINAL: Real-time PM2 logs (backend / frontend / nginx) switchable.\n     Last 50 lines displayed, auto-scrolls to bottom.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: REFRESH LOGS, ANALYZE, DISMISS, DISMISS ANALYZED, APPROVE, REJECT, INITIATE SOVEREIGN SRE SCAN, AUTHORIZE BRAIN INJECTION & FIX PERMANENTLY, RESTART SERVICE]"
    },
