      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE GUEST — GUEST CONCIERGE PORTAL (Guest-facing interface).\n\nThis is what guests see when they log into the Miracle OS Guest App or web portal.\n\nAVAILABLE TABS FOR GUESTS:\n  /guest/hub — Main dashboard: Welcome message, current room status, quick actions\n  /guest/folio — View real-time bill: All charges, advance paid, current balance\n  /guest/order — Room service / food ordering from the resort menu\n  /guest/reserve — Extend stay or request future booking\n  /guest/concierge — Message front desk, request services (towels, housekeeping, etc.)\n  /guest/ecommerce — Shop resort merchandise\n  /guest/profile — View loyalty coins, VIP tier, past stays\n\nAll guest requests flow to Z-07 (Command Grid) and Z-17 (Solve Portal) for staff action.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: ORDER NOW, VIEW MY BILL, REQUEST SERVICE, EXTEND STAY, CHAT WITH FRONT DESK]"
