      "ai_knowledge": "COMPLETE MIRACLE OS ZONE DIRECTORY (30 ZONES): Z-07=Command Grid (God view, 30 rooms, real-time status) | Z-05=Reservations (45-day tape chart, booking, walk-in, CRM vault) | Z-06=POS/Retail (point of sale, room charge, F&B, spa, stock auto-deduction) | Z-25=Guest Marketing (APK distribution, WhatsApp blast, loyalty) | Z-08=Checkout/Billing (guest folio settlement, split bill, advance deposit) | Z-16=Issue Tickets (raise maintenance/HK/IT tickets, CRITICAL triggers grid alert) | Z-17=Solve Portal (field mission board, photo proof, CDO override) | Z-18=Biometric Portal (staff attendance, access logs, shift verification) | Z-12=Inventory Matrix (stock vault, PAR levels, Receiving Bay, BOM recipes) | Z-09=HR/Personnel (staff registry, payroll, efficiency ratings, AUTHORIZE SYNC) | Z-10=CRM/Guest Loyalty (guest profiles, LTV, VIP tiers, loyalty coins) | Z-11=Accounts & Finance (P&L, Chart of Accounts, AP/AR, double-entry ledger, payroll disbursements, night audit) | Z-19=Policy Engine (ROOM PRICES HERE — Units tab, Base Rate column; also: Global Laws, Yield Rules, Seasonal Calendar, SOP Matrix, Maintenance Lock, Bulk Seed) | Z-21=Kernel Settings (user accounts, roles, permissions, auth config) | Z-23=Sovereign Infra (VPS monitoring, PM2, DNS, deployment) | Z-14=Media Lab (digital asset management) | Z-20=Synapse Nexus (War Room Kanban, Neural Tree org-chart, AI Directive Decompiler, Video Conf) | Z-26=Wellness & Spa (treatments, therapists, appointments, spa revenue) | Z-27=Boutiques & Retail (product catalog, pricing, image gallery, sales analytics) | Z-28=Fleet & Transport (vehicles, drivers, airport transfers, commission engine) | Z-29=F&B (menu management, dining reservations, kitchen signals, COGS) | Z-30=PMS V2.0 (Sovereign Asset Portfolio Engine: FULL_OWNER/MORTGAGE_BUYER/RENTAL_OWNER/RENTED/AFFILIATED ownership classes, UDI rental pool math, mortgage amortization engine, AI fair rotation dispatcher, 6-axis compliance scan, data integrity scoring, AGI bot /agi commands, Synapse HK automation on checkout, 10 tabs: Portfolio/Gallery/BOM/CardVault/Ledger/OwnerPayouts/MortgageEngine/RentalPools/AICompliance/AIDispatch) | Z-GUEST=Guest App (concierge, ecommerce, folio view, loyalty). KEY RULES: Room prices are set ONLY in Z-19 Policy Engine > Units tab > Base Rate column. Staff logins are created in Z-21. Payroll is in Z-09. Revenue reports are in Z-11. Inventory stock levels are in Z-12. Service Empire (Z-26 to Z-29) revenue all auto-posts to Z-11. PMS mortgage/pool yields auto-post to Z-11 on checkout."
