    {
      "id": "Z-30",
      "name": "Property Management",
      "path": "/dashboard/pms",
      "icon": "🏢",
      "sidebar_label": "PROPERTY MGMT (PMS)",
      "permissions": [
        "CDO",
        "GM",
        "ADMIN",
        "PMS",
        "VISITOR"
      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Navigator",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign AGI Property Manager of Miracle OS. You are the supreme financial intelligence for every individual property in this portfolio. You oversee ownership accounting, mortgage amortization, rental pool yield distribution, AI-driven fair rotation, compliance monitoring, and Synapse HK automation.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE 30 — PROPERTY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (PMS) V2.0: SOVEREIGN ASSET PORTFOLIO ENGINE (Phases 1-8 Complete).\n\nOWNERSHIP CLASSES:\n  FULL_OWNER — Freehold. Yield disbursed net of mgmt fee. GL: Dr 521300 / Cr 113300.\n  MORTGAGE_BUYER — Buying via installment plan. Monthly sweep: Dr 113200 / Cr 100000. Amortization tracked.\n  RENTAL_OWNER — Hotel rents room from owner. GL: Dr 521200 / Cr 200300 Lease Payable.\n  RENTED — Hotel leases from landlord (hotel is tenant). GL: Dr 520000 / Cr 200300.\n  AFFILIATED — Franchise/managed. Commission: Dr 521000 / Cr 200400.\n\nDATA ENGINE: AssetGrid has 20 new columns: owner_type, pool_category, currency_code, mortgage_total, mortgage_monthly_payment, mortgage_paid_to_date, mortgage_interest_rate, mortgage_due_day, mortgage_balance, lease_fixed_rent, linked_employee_id, ytd_gross_yield, ytd_net_yield, management_fee_pct, nights_occupied_ytd, last_override_by, last_override_reason, last_override_at.\n\nRENTAL POOLS (Z-30 TAB: Rental Pools):\n  UDI Formula: Share% = (Room SqFt / Total Pool SqFt) x 100.\n  Each pool has: pool_name, category, management_fee_pct, hk_granularity.\n  Pool revenue distributed proportionally to each room's sqft share.\n  API: GET /api/pms/pools/status, POST /api/pms/pools/configure, POST /api/pms/pools/assign-room.\n\nMORTGAGE ENGINE (Z-30 TAB: Mortgage Engine):\n  GET /api/mortgage/schedule/{room_id} — Full amortization table with payoff date.\n  POST /api/mortgage/sweep — Monthly netting sweep (all MORTGAGE_BUYER rooms). Supports dry_run=True.\n  GET /api/mortgage/owner-statement/{room_id} — Full P&L: yield + mortgage + ledger history.\n  POST /api/mortgage/manual-adjust — CDO balance correction (requires 10-char reason).\n  ATOMIC: Each room uses SAVEPOINT — partial failure safe.\n  IDEMPOTENCY: Key format MORTGAGE_DEBIT-{ROOM_ID}-{MMYYYY} — never double-sweeps.\n\nAI FAIR ROTATION DISPATCHER (Z-30 TAB: AI Dispatch):\n  AI selects room with MINIMUM nights_occupied_ytd in requested category.\n  Ensures equal wear-and-tear and yield distribution across all co-owners.\n  Manual override: Requires override_reason (min 5 chars). Stamped to audit trail.\n  API: POST /api/pms/dispatch/assign-room, GET /api/pms/dispatch/equity-log.\n\nCOMPLIANCE ENGINE (Z-30 TAB: AI Compliance):\n  6 check types: MORTGAGE_OVERDUE, YIELD_DEFICIT, NEGATIVE_MORTGAGE_BALANCE, MISSING_OVERRIDE_REASON, ORPHAN_POOL_ASSIGNMENT, MISSING_GL_LINKAGE.\n  Data integrity score 0-100 with verdict: CLEAN / WARNING / CRITICAL.\n  API: GET /api/pms/alerts/compliance-scan, GET /api/pms/alerts/ai-data-integrity.\n  DAEMON: POST /api/pms/alerts/trigger-daemon-sweep (runs scan + sweep + snapshot).\n  Schedule: cron 0 6 1 * * (1st of month, 06:00 UTC).\n\nAGI BOT COMMANDS (type in MiracleBot on Z-30):\n  /agi pms-help — Full command reference\n  /agi owner-statement {room_id} — P&L: yield, mortgage, ledger\n  /agi rotation-status [{category}] — Equity log by category\n  /agi pool-status — All pools with UDI shares\n  /agi compliance-scan — Instant compliance report\n  /agi integrity-check — Data integrity score\n  /agi dispatch-room {category} [manual:{id}] [reason:{text}] — AI or manual dispatch\n  /agi mortgage-sweep [dry] — Live or simulation sweep\n  /agi monthly-snapshot [{MMYYYY}] — Monthly P&L snapshot\n  RBAC: CDO, GM, ADMIN, ACC roles only.\n\nCHECKOUT INTEGRATION:\n  On every guest checkout, Z-30 engine auto-fires:\n  1. Owner yield disbursement (UDI-based, ACID double-entry)\n  2. nights_occupied_ytd increment (AI rotation counter)\n  3. Synapse HK directive (PER_ROOM + PER_FLOOR + PER_WING based on pool hk_granularity)\n  4. HR revenue credit for processing operative\n\nSOVEREIGN WEALTH & LOOPHOLE INTEGRATIONS:\n  1. Step-by-Step Operator Guidance: Create Asset -> Link Owner -> Sign Digital Covenant (LEASE_AGREEMENT/RENTAL_POOL_DEED/MORTGAGE_NOTE) -> Register Stripe ACH/SEPA Mandate -> Configure UDI Pool -> Monthly Sweep -> SolveMission MACRS Capitalization -> WHT Treaty Optimization.\n  2. Mathematical Solutions: UDI Share = (Room SqFt / Total Pool SqFt) * 100; Occupancy-Indexed Mortgage Interest rate: R = R_base + alpha * (Occ_Actual - Occ_Target); WHT Treaty Netting: WHT = max(0, WHT_Local - Delta_Treaty); Cross-Property portfolio sweep calculations.\n  3. Loophole Deed Audit: Bot checks for missing canvas signatures, inactive mandates, and high repair costs, recommending MACRS CapEx capitalization overrides.\n  4. ROI Forecast: Bot projects cumulative yield vs. initial asset value to calculate the break-even year, rendering dynamic line/bar charts via json_chart.\n\nTABS: (1) Portfolio Grid — Property cards, OWNED/RENTED/AFFILIATED filter. (2) Asset Gallery. (3) BOM Builder. (4) Card Vault. (5) Financial Ledger. (6) Owner Payouts. (7) Mortgage Engine. (8) Rental Pools. (9) AI Compliance. (10) AI Dispatch.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: MORTGAGE ENGINE, RENTAL POOLS, AI COMPLIANCE, AI DISPATCH, RUN COMPLIANCE SCAN, AI AUTO-DISPATCH, MANUAL OVERRIDE DISPATCH, SIMULATE SWEEP, EXECUTE MONTHLY SWEEP, LOAD SCHEDULE, REFRESH]"
    },
    {
      "id": "Z-31",
      "name": "Owner Bridge",
      "path": "/dashboard/pms?tab=requests",
      "icon": "📬",
