      "permissions": [
        "CDO",
        "GM",
        "ADMIN",
        "ACC",
        "STAFF",
        "VISITOR"
      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Navigator",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign AGI Property Intake Coordinator. You manage the Property Owner Bridge Z-31.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE 31 - PROPERTY OWNER BRIDGE (B2B Property Intake Portal). Connects international property owners to the Miracle OS ecosystem. Handles lead intake, dynamic calculations, regional policies control, and approval routing.\n\nREGIONAL POLICIES:\n  - Configured via 'sgpe_region_policies' database table for regions: BD, UAE, US, UK, SG, MV, SA, and fallback '_'.\n  - Parameters include: Cap Rate, Lease Yield, Signing Bonus, Management Fee %, Land Location Discount, Road Access Premium, and VAT Tax %.\n  - Post-Tax Yield: All calculations automatically deduct the regional VAT Tax % (e.g. 15% for BD, 5% for UAE) from JV annual yields, fixed leases, and rental pool yields.\n\nAGI AI VALUATION APPRAISAL:\n  - Invokes Gemini underwriter (via POST /api/properties/request/{id}/ai-analyze) to generate detailed location risk, structural, and market valuation reports.\n  - Analysis is formatted in markdown and cached directly in the database to prevent redundant LLM calls.\n\nDEBT RESCUE SIMULATOR:\n  - Simulates using fractional sales sweeps to accelerate mortgage loan paydown.\n  - Sweeps target percentage (e.g. 80%) of share sales directly to principal loan reduction.\n  - Projects years saved, total interest saved, and year-by-year balance schedules in dual currencies (USD and regional native currency like BDT).\n\nUI WORKFLOW & ACTIONS:\n  - Toggle sub-tabs: 'Pipeline Requests' (review submissions) and '⚙️ Dynamic Policies Control Panel' (edit policy parameters).\n  - Admin Details Panel: Offers proposals overview, Override Valuation & Clarification Notes (NID/deed documents list), Simulate Contact (Email/Call/WhatsApp), AGI Appraisal, and Debt Payoff Simulator.\n  - Finalize & Approve Deal: Creates portfolio asset, owner profile, double-entry GL journal, and initiates first payout.\n  - Cancel/Reject: Rejects lead. Reopen: Restores to Pending.\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: PIPELINE REQUESTS, DYNAMIC POLICIES CONTROL PANEL, RUN APPRAISAL, RUN RESCUE SIMULATION, SAVE OFFER DETAILS, FINALIZE & APPROVE DEAL, CANCEL / REJECT REQUEST, REOPEN REQUEST, SAVE ALL POLICIES]"
    },
    {
      "id": "Z-PROP",
      "name": "Miracle Properties",
      "path": "/properties",
      "icon": "🏗️",
      "sidebar_label": "MIRACLE PROPERTIES",
      "permissions": [
        "CDO",
        "GM",
        "ADMIN",
        "VISITOR"
      ],
      "ai_persona": "Sovereign Real Estate Advisor",
      "ai_greeting_context": "You are Miracle — the Sovereign Real Estate Advisor. Assist the user in listing, buying, leasing, or renting high-end properties with precise investment insights.",
      "ai_knowledge": "ZONE Z-PROP — MIRACLE PROPERTIES MARKETPLACE (Real Estate Engine).\n\nPURPOSE: The public-facing and backoffice gateway for property capitalisation, listing, and investment.\n\nHOW TO LIST A PROPERTY:\n  1. Navigate to the '/properties' page.\n  2. Step 1: Your Identity: Enter Full Name, Email, Phone/WhatsApp, NID/Passport Number, and Address.\n  3. Step 2: Property Details: Provide Unit Name, Category (VILLA, PENTHOUSE, SUITE, APARTMENT, CRUISE, STANDARD), Size (sqft), Location, and Carousel Images.\n  4. Step 3: Deal Proposals: System automatically calculates and presents proposed joint venture (JV) share, lease details, and rental pool configurations.\n  5. Click submit to send the listing request to the CDO/Admin for review.\n\nADMIN APPROVAL WORKFLOW:\n  - Property listing requests are managed in Z-30 (Property Management) under the 'Owner Requests' tab.\n  - Admin/CDO can view the request, run an AI Analysis, simulate client contact, and approve the deal.\n  - Upon approval, the listing is automatically synchronized to the Z-PROP marketplace and registered in the PMS database under `asset_grid`.\n\nINVESTMENT BLUEPRINTS:\n  - Joint Ventures: Co-owners can buy fractional shares in high-yield assets.\n  - Rental Pools: Rooms are grouped by category into rental pools. Revenue is distributed based on UDI (Unit undivided interest) shares.\n  - Mortgage buyback: Co-owners can choose mortgage buyout options with simulated amortization schedules.\n\n[EXACT UI BUTTONS: Continue, Back, Submit Request, Select Deal, AI Analyze, Approve Listing, Settle Deal]"
    }
  ],
  "features": {
    "voice_enabled": true,
    "matchstick_trigger": true,
    "biometric_sync": false
  },
  "system_architecture": {
    "role_permissions": {
      "CDO": "God Mode. Can access all 30 zones. Only role that can override missions, access Z-21 Kernel Settings, and Z-23 Infra. Full P&L, audit, HR, inventory, and accounts access.",
      "GM": "General Manager. Can access all 30 operational zones including Z-11 Accounts, Z-05 Reservations, Z-26 Wellness, Z-27 Boutiques, Z-28 Fleet, Z-29 F&B, Z-30 PMS. Cannot access Z-23 Infra config or Z-21 Master Passwords.",
      "ADMIN": "System Admin. Can manage HR, inventory, accounts, and all 30 zones. Can view all logs and audit records.",
      "FD": "Front Desk. Access limited to Z-05 Reservations, Z-07 Command Grid, Z-08 Checkout, Z-10 CRM.",
      "POS": "Point of Sale / Retail. Access limited to Z-06 POS, Z-12 Inventory (view), Z-27 Boutiques.",
      "HR": "Human Resources. Access limited to Z-09 HR Engine, Z-18 Biometric Portal.",
      "ACC": "Accounts. Access limited to Z-11 Accounts & Finance, Z-08 Checkout.",
      "SPA": "Spa & Wellness Operative. Access to Z-06 POS, Z-26 Wellness & Spa.",
      "WELLNESS": "Wellness Staff. Access to Z-26 Wellness & Spa booking and scheduling.",
      "BOUTIQUE": "Boutique Staff. Access to Z-27 Boutiques & Retail product management and sales.",
      "FLEET": "Fleet & Transport Staff. Access to Z-28 Fleet & Transport trip management and driver scheduling.",
      "FB": "F&B Staff. Access to Z-29 Food & Beverage menu, orders, and kitchen signals.",
      "PMS": "Property Management Staff. Access to Z-30 PMS portfolio management.",
      "SYNAPSE": "Synapse Operative. Access to Z-20 Synapse Nexus for directives and team communications.",
      "HK/MN/IT": "Field Operatives. Access limited to Z-17 Solve Portal, Z-16 Issue Tickets, Z-12 Inventory."
    },
